---
// EarlifyFounder.astro - Fundador & CEO: Dr. Frank Alberto Betances Reinoso
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<section id="fundador" class="earlify-founder section-padding" aria-labelledby="founder-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="founder-card glass-card">
      <div class="founder-top">
        <div class="avatar-wrapper">
          <div class="avatar-ring">
            <div class="avatar-content">
              <img 
                src={`${baseUrl}/assets/dr-frank-betances.jpg`} 
                alt="Dr. Frank Alberto Betances Reinoso · Fundador & CEO de Earlify Health S.L." 
                class="avatar-img"
                loading="lazy" 
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="founder-info">
          <div class="badge-row">
            <span class="badge badge-purple">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg>
              <span>Fundador &amp; CEO · Earlify Health S.L.</span>
            </span>
            <span class="badge badge-cyan">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
              <span>FEA Otorrinolaringología Infantil</span>
            </span>
            <span class="badge badge-emerald">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"></path></svg>
              <span>Doctorando USC</span>
            </span>
          </div>

          <h2 id="founder-title" class="founder-title">
            Dr. Frank Alberto <span class="gradient-text">Betances Reinoso</span>
          </h2>

          <p class="founder-lead">
            FEA de Otorrinolaringología Infantil (Hospital Ribera Polusa Lugo / CHUO Ourense), Doctorando e Investigador en Salud Digital (Universidade de Santiago de Compostela). Frank encarna <strong>"La Tríada"</strong> que sostiene la ventaja competitiva y el rigor sanitario de Earlify Health:
          </p>

          <div class="triad-grid">
            <div class="triad-item">
              <div class="triad-num">1</div>
              <div class="triad-text">
                <strong>1. Médico Asistencial</strong>
                <p>Otorrinolaringólogo pediátrico en trinchera hospitalaria. Conoce de primera mano la sobrecarga asistencial, las limitaciones temporales de exploración y la angustia de las familias atrapadas en listas de espera de atención temprana.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="triad-item">
              <div class="triad-num">2</div>
              <div class="triad-text">
                <strong>2. Investigador Clínico</strong>
                <p>Doctorando en la Universidade de Santiago de Compostela (USC), centrado en la rehabilitación digital del lenguaje, biomarcadores acústicos y evaluación de software médico conforme al marco regulatorio MDR e IEC 62304.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="triad-item">
              <div class="triad-num">3</div>
              <div class="triad-text">
                <strong>3. Emprendedor HealthTech</strong>
                <p>Fundador y CEO de Earlify Health S.L. Liderazgo y capacidad técnica de ejecución para transformar la necesidad médica empírica en soluciones SaMD y dispositivos AIoT rigurosos, escalables y auditables.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Cierre Canónico del Fundador -->
          <div class="founder-quote-box">
            <div class="founder-tagline">“Menos ruido. Más criterio.”</div>
            <p class="founder-quote">
              «Conocemos el problema porque lo padecemos todos los días. Earlify no sustituye el juicio profesional ni el de la familia: lo ordena y le da continuidad.»
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="founder-actions">
            <a href={`${baseUrl}/cv`} class="btn-primary-founder">
              <span>Ver Currículum Vítae Completo (CV)</span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6349-9537" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary-founder">
              <span>ORCID 0000-0002-6349-9537</span>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .earlify-founder {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(70px, 10vw, 115px) 0;
    background-color: var(--bg-dark, #07090e);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .founder-card {
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  }

  .founder-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .avatar-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .avatar-ring {
    width: 240px;
    height: 240px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    padding: 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f2fe 0%, #a855f7 50%, #f59e0b 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
  }

  .avatar-content {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #0b1120;
  }

  .avatar-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .badge-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .badge-purple { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12); color: #c084fc; border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25); }
  .badge-cyan { background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12); color: #00f2fe; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.25); }
  .badge-emerald { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12); color: #34d399; border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25); }

  .founder-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f2fe 0%, #a855f7 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .founder-lead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #cbd5e1);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .triad-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .triad-item {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .triad-num {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
    color: #00f2fe;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .triad-text strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .triad-text p {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .founder-quote-box {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08);
    border-left: 3px solid #a855f7;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .founder-tagline {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c084fc;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .founder-quote {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .founder-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary-founder {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
    min-height: 48px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f2fe 0%, #4facfe 100%);
    color: #041017;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary-founder:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
  }

  .btn-secondary-founder {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem;
    min-height: 48px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }
  .btn-secondary-founder:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .founder-top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .badge-row, .founder-actions {
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .triad-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .founder-quote-box {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
